{"synopsis":"Jang Yiseo, seorang mata-mata dari Aliansi Murim yang menyusup ke Kultus Iblis, itu adalah misi pertama dan terakhirnya.\nUntuk menjadi Tuan Muda Ketujuh yang terkenal, Ma-oh, sebagai Wakil Ketua Sekte!\n\nMeskipun memiliki bela diri yang luar biasa, potensi Yiseo terhalang oleh konstitusinya yang lemah.\nSementara itu, Ma-Oh, kekuatan yang luar biasa namun tidak dapat diprediksi, berjalan di garis tipis antara kejeniusan dan kegilaan.\n\nSaat nasib mereka saling terkait, keduanya harus menghadapi pengkhianatan, perebutan kekuasaan, dan risiko yang selalu ada untuk terungkap.\nBisakah Jang Yiseo membuat Ma-Oh naik ke peringkat kedua setelah Ketua Sekte, atau akankah bayangan melahap mereka terlebih dahulu?","alternative_title":"첩자의 마교생활","author":"그림","artist":"글/원작","chapters":[{"number":"25","chapter":"25","slug":"25041cf8-6e33-4282-955b-37ff47b5d82a","title":"Chapter 25","date":"2026-06-04"},{"number":"24","chapter":"24","slug":"7b900df4-702e-4b5d-b83e-01e46633c456","title":"Chapter 24","date":"2026-06-04"},{"number":"23","chapter":"23","slug":"a9895f94-df52-4d86-ae7d-08715a0fb69a","title":"Chapter 23","date":"2026-05-18"},{"number":"22","chapter":"22","slug":"0d9ca17e-57c2-478a-848f-abcbc0a786bf","title":"Chapter 22","date":"2026-05-02"},{"number":"21","chapter":"21","slug":"05ac1928-6be5-47d9-ae38-c56341e3a4b9","title":"Chapter 21","date":"2026-05-01"},{"number":"20","chapter":"20","slug":"1a6ab039-dd7e-4512-8de6-3b6faf0d35a3","title":"Chapter 20","date":"2026-04-22"},{"number":"19","chapter":"19","slug":"a047eb71-e34c-43b5-b822-05efeb22f96c","title":"Chapter 19","date":"2026-04-17"},{"number":"18","chapter":"18","slug":"5caf2c1c-2b51-4bbc-8776-62e468116513","title":"Chapter 18","date":"2026-03-30"},{"number":"17","chapter":"17","slug":"3c621c86-6f84-4cc0-8898-6df8ce08b039","title":"Chapter 17","date":"2026-03-14"},{"number":"16","chapter":"16","slug":"b217b137-e120-4ae4-8b2f-30b66c3576c7","title":"Chapter 16","date":"2026-02-28"},{"number":"15","c